    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "43353988c7f2a0888ee1": "My question to you is this, $c:$BWhich of the Aspects created by the titans became the nefarious creature known as Deathwing?",
        "74ecf1077cb2af7aac99": "Greetings, $c. Is there something I can help you with?"
